  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kvinna till Kvinna Regional Programme - Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The regional programme, funded by FCDO and lead by the Kvinna till Kvinna Foundation, aims to address challenges in the Western Balkans related to growing nationalism, anti-democratic developments, and anti-rights movements, contributing to a shrinking civic space and negative attitudes towards gender equality, women&#x2019;s rights and the LGBT+ community. Responding to these challenges through the support of 18 partner organisations in the region, the overarching goal is to support the improved resilience and capacity of civil society in Western Balkans that contribute to the realisation of women&#x2019;s rights and the rights of LGBT+ persons.</narrative>
  </description>
